    "why": "Legend on the map (index of symbols): overlined numbers are floor depths in feet, circled numbers ceiling-to-floor heights in feet, r minor and x major restriction, z zero visibility, s silty, P. penetrations from the entrance in feet, wavy arrow direction of current. OCR read 8 of the 33 depths (two misread: 70 as 10 and 79); the other 25 were found by eye on gridded crops (extra). 10 of 18 circled heights found, three misread (8 and 5 as 3); the rest added. False silt matches (labels, stipple, hatching) dropped; missed s/z added where seen. Penetration labels added (OCR read only P.400). No bones, skulls or fossils on the map (searched the OCR words and the plan); no 'To ...' pointers. The ringed 'T80'-like mark east of the Chamber of Horrors (1921,787) is unclear (boulders or an unlisted symbol): not kept."
